<title>AUSTRIA: Lenzing says expects to post 1996 loss.</title>
<headline>Lenzing says expects to post 1996 loss.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian fibre manufacturer Lenzing AG said on Tuesday sales in the first nine months of the year gained 0.5 percent to 6.075 billion schillings ($574.5 million) and that it expects to post a loss for the full year.</p>
<p>Lenzing said it did not expect market conditions to stabilise before 1997, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>In the year-ago period, Lenzing posted sales of 6.042 billion schillings. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 274 ($ = 10.57 Austrian Schillings)</p>
